# Build-context allowlist for the Docker images under scripts/docker/.
# Keeps the build tarball small and reproducible by excluding everything
# the Rust compiler does not need.

target/
**/target/
.git/
.github/
.kiro/
.cursor/
docs/
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
*.env
.env
**/*.keypair.json
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Keep the workspace README at the root in case any crate's `[package].readme`
# field references it.
!README.md
